:\\\"източник\\\"}]}]]}]\\n1e:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"tr\\\",\\\"Поскъпване на горивата за година, май 2026: България / ЕС\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"border-b border-rule\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"td\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"py-1.5 pr-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Поскъпване на горивата за година, май 2026: България / ЕС\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"td\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"px-2 text-right font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"33,9% / 20,7%\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"td\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"px-2 text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",null,{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.intellinews.com/bulgaria-records-eu-s-sharpest-fuel-price-rise-in-may-450039/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"източник\\\"}]}]]}]\\n1f:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"Публично твърдение\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mb-10\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Публично твърдение\\\"}],\\\"$undefined\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"grid gap-3\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"article\\\",\\\"goriva-1\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm bg-white p-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#fbecc4] text-[#6b4a00]\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Подвеждащо\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm font-semibold\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Публично твърдение\\\"}],\\\"$undefined\\\",[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm text-muted ml-auto\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"18 ноември 2026 г.\\\"}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-[17px] font-semibold leading-snug\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"„\\\",\\\"Горивата са скъпи заради новото правителство.\\\",\\\"“\\\"]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-[15px] mt-2\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Поскъпването започна на 28 февруари 2026 г. с войната в Иран, при служебно правителство, и обхвана целия ЕС. Ръстът у нас е най-голям в ЕС главно защото тръгнахме от най-ниските цени. Дори сега България е сред трите държави с най-евтини горива. Правителството влияе чрез данъците върху горивата и чрез конкуренцията на пазара, но не определя световната цена на петрола.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"https://www.bta.bg/bg/news/1079358-gorivata-v-stranata-poskapvat-mezhdu-6-i-9-protsenta-za-sedmitsa-sochat-dannite\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.bta.bg/bg/news/1079358-gorivata-v-stranata-poskapvat-mezhdu-6-i-9-protsenta-za-sedmitsa-sochat-dannite\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"БТА: горивата поскъпват с 6–9% за седмица, Брент над 100 $\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"https://www.intellinews.com/bulgaria-records-eu-s-sharpest-fuel-price-rise-in-may-450039/\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.intellinews.com/bulgaria-records-eu-s-sharpest-fuel-price-rise-in-may-450039/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"bne IntelliNews: България с най-голямо поскъпване в ЕС през май (Евростат)\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"https://www.fuel-prices.eu/news/bulgaria-petrol-below-1-60-eur-2026-11-09/\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://www.fuel-prices.eu/news/bulgaria-petrol-below-1-60-eur-2026-11-09/\\\",\\\"target\\\":\\\"_blank\\\",\\\"rel\\\":\\\"noreferrer\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Fuel-prices.eu по Weekly Oil Bulletin на ЕК, 9 ноември 2026\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"a\\\",\\\"https://cpc.bg/media/0212/Ре-26.pdf\\\",{\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://cpc.bg/media/0212/Ре-26.pdf\\\